---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { ContributionPosterBoard } from "@/components/ContributionPoster";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Yogdaan aur Support | Nagrik Party"
  description="Nagrik Party ke Formation Phase operations me yogdaan dein. UPI ya bank transfer se. Har rupaya public ledger me, koi cash nahi."
>
  <style is:global>
    /* Print: sirf poster chhape, A4/A5 me, bina kisi extra button ke (Rule 23) */
    @media print {
      .nav-wrapper,
      .bottom-nav,
      .help-fab,
      .install-banner,
      footer,
      .page-hero,
      .no-print,
      .contribute-section,
      .contribute-cta {
        display: none !important;
      }
      body,
      .site-shell,
      main {
        background: #ffffff !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
      }
      .poster-shell {
        padding: 0 !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
      }
      .poster-frame {
        width: auto !important;
        height: auto !important;
        overflow: visible !important;
      }
      .poster-scaler {
        transform: none !important;
        width: auto !important;
        height: auto !important;
      }
      .contribution-poster {
        box-shadow: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
      <div class="mini-label" style="background: rgba(179, 74, 21, 0.08); color: var(--saffron);">
        PHASE 1 · FORMATION PHASE
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.1rem); margin: 10px 0 14px; font-family: var(--font-serif); line-height: 1.15;">
        Yogdaan dijiye, party banane me
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 18px); color: var(--ink-body); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 700px;">
        Party banane ka kharcha bada hota hai: forms, printing, chhote office ka kharcha, digital system aur volunteer ka safar.
        Yeh kharcha bade businessmen se nahi, aap jaise nagrik ke chhote yogdaan se uthana hai.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
      <div
        class="card"
        style="background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-left: 3px solid var(--saffron); border-radius: 4px; padding: 18px 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);"
      >
        <span class="mini-label" style="background: rgba(179, 74, 21, 0.08); color: var(--saffron); font-size: 11px;">
          ZAROORI BAAT · PEHLE PADHEIN
        </span>
        <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--ink);">
          Registration se pehle yogdaan par tax chhoot nahi milti
        </h3>
        <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">
          Nagrik Party abhi ECI registration ki taraf badh rahi hai. Registered party banne se pehle diya gaya yogdaan
          Income Tax Act ke section 80GGB ya 80GGC ke tahat claim nahi ho sakta. Hum yeh baat chhupate nahi. Yogdaan poora
          voluntary hai, aur jo bhi yogdaan aata hai wo public ledger me naam ke saath likha jaata hai.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ContributionPosterBoard client:only="react" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section contribute-section" style="padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 50px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-family: var(--font-serif); margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--ink);">
        Paisa kahan jaata hai
      </h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
        <div class="card" style="padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px;">
          <strong style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--ink);">Ground ka kaam</strong>
          <span style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55;">
            Ward level par member milna, ghar ghar jaana, chhote nukkad meetup, banner aur pamphlet.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px;">
          <strong style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--ink);">Digital system</strong>
          <span style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55;">
            Membership register, complaint aur RTI system, aur public ledger chalaane ka server kharcha.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px;">
          <strong style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--ink);">Legal aur paperwork</strong>
          <span style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55;">
            Constitution drafting, CA aur lawyer fees, aur ECI registration ki file taiyaari.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-family: var(--font-serif); margin: 34px 0 12px; color: var(--ink);">
        Hum kya nahi karte
      </h2>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--ink-body); line-height: 1.8;">
        <li>Cash yogdaan nahi lete. Sirf UPI ya bank transfer.</li>
        <li>Bade businessman ya company se badi funding nahi lete.</li>
        <li>Yogdaan ke badle koi pad ya ticket ka vaada nahi karte.</li>
        <li>Kisi ko tax chhoot ka jhootha vaada nahi karte.</li>
      </ul>

      <div
        class="contribute-cta"
        style="margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px 22px; background: var(--paper-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px;"
      >
        <strong style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--ink);">Yogdaan se membership nahi milti</strong>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6;">
          Membership free hai, aur har member ko ek hi vote milta hai, chahe yogdaan kuch bhi ho. Pehle member baniye,
          phir chahein toh yogdaan dijiye.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">
          <a class="button" href="/membership" style="padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 700;">Member Baniye</a>
          <a class="button" href="/transparency" style="padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 700;">Poora Hisaab Dekhein</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); line-height: 1.6;">
        Note: 20,000 rupaye se zyada ka yogdaan dene par hum aapka naam, PAN aur address record karte hain, kyunki election
        rules me reporting zaroori hai. Chhote yogdaan ke liye sirf naam aur mobile number rakha jaata hai.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
